# multi-session track worktrees symlink these back to the canonical checkout —
# never let git track the symlink itself (collides with the real dir on main).
# NOTE: no trailing slash — these are symlinks in track worktrees, and a
# trailing-slash gitignore pattern does NOT match a symlink-to-directory.
